  "ruleText": "Gen 101.01 Purpose. This chapter sets forth the organization and statutory responsibilities of the genetic counselors governing board and the manner of communication with the board.\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26",
